        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_139_Part2FourVariables,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_145_Part3UphillFutures,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_148_Part4CompositeWorlds,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_150_Part5PersonalLandscapes,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_151_Part6PlanningUnderUncertainty ;
    skos:prefLabel "How to Think About the Future"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "6-part Frankly series (Frankly #138/139/145/148/150/151), confirmed complete 2026-07-15/16 via all 6 real transcripts. Grew organically, same pattern as Bend Not Break — Part 4's own opening notes the series kept getting longer than planned, and Part 5 was originally meant to be the finale before Hagens split it into a personal-application aside (Part 5) plus a separate planning-methodology closer (Part 6). Part 4 is the framework-defining episode (the 4-Dimension/16-Facet/256-combination scenario matrix, modeled in scenariodimensions.ttl/scenariofacets.ttl/scenarios.ttl) — Parts 1-3 build the conceptual groundwork, Parts 5-6 apply it."@en ;
    .

