tgs:Series.AGuideToStayingHuman a thinkr:Series, dcmitype:Collection, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dct:hasPart 
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_129_DesperatelySeekingAgency, 
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_142_GuideToStayingHumanPart2, 
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_143_GuideToStayingHumanPart3 ;
    skos:prefLabel "A Guide to Staying Human"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINTED 2026-08-24, resolving the gap flagged in Frankly_142's own scopeNote since 2026-08-13. Tentatively titled by Nate himself ('staying Human tentatively the title' — Frankly_129's own opening). 3 parts confirmed via direct transcript evidence of forward/backward referencing across all three: Part 1 (Agency) → Part 2 explicitly builds on Part 1 ('I spent the first installment of this series on reclaiming agency') and forward-points to Part 3 ('part three... will pick up soon on presence and the default mode network') → Part 3 explicitly builds on Part 2 ('the same phenomenon I called full dread in last week's Frankly'). No confirmed Part 4 as of this pass — Nate's own words in Part 1 ('more soon in this series') leave it open-ended; revisit dct:hasPart if a Part 4 surfaces."@en ;
    .

tgs:Series.OilTrilogy a thinkr:Series, dcmitype:Collection, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dct:hasPart
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_135_OilOneOhOne,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_136_OilTwoOhOne,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_137_OilThreeOhOne ;
    skos:prefLabel "The Oil Trilogy (Oil 101 / 201 / 301)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINTED 2026-09-10, per MJSullivan's own direct instruction, following the same Series pattern established for tgs:Series.AGuideToStayingHuman. Real, direct, explicit series, not inferred: Nate's own words in Frankly_135's own opening state plainly this is 'a three part video series on oil,' rush-produced in three days and released on three consecutive days (Apr 9-11, 2026), prompted directly by the real, unfolding 2026 Strait of Hormuz crisis. All 3 parts confirmed via direct transcript evidence of forward/backward referencing across all three: Part 1 (Oil 101, what oil is and does) explicitly previews Part 2 ('we'll explore this in the next video, part two of our intro trilogy on oil') → Part 2 (Oil 201, institutional dependence and depletion) explicitly closes by pointing to Part 3 ('in the final video of this trilogy, I'll explain what all this means for money, for civilization, and for what comes next') → Part 3 (Oil 301, money, geopolitics, and what comes after) explicitly opens by naming itself 'the third and final video in this series' and directly references 'as we covered in the previous video' regarding shale depletion. Real, direct, complete trilogy — Part 3 itself states this is the final installment, unlike A Guide to Staying Human's own open-ended structure; no further parts expected unless directly contradicted by future material."@en ;
    .

tgs:Series.UncomfortableQuestionsForUnsettledTimes a thinkr:Series, dcmitype:Collection, owl:NamedIndividual ;
